flowchart TD
  USER["Keyboard mic press"] --> KB["KeyboardViewController intent / destination token"]
  KB --> BOOT{"Persisted active recording?"}
  BOOT -->|yes F-0014: stale shortcut| PING["Host ping only, no bounded start request"]
  BOOT -->|no| DARWIN["Darwin start + bounded retry/fallback"]
  DARWIN --> HOST["SpeechRecognitionService.startCapture"]
  HOST --> HEALTH{"AVAudioEngine isRunning + session owner?"}
  HEALTH -->|no| START["startSession: AVAudioSession + persistent input tap"]
  HEALTH -->|yes| CAPTURE["beginCapture: single enum owner"]
  START --> CAPTURE
  CAPTURE --> BUFFER["16k FIFO accumulator + CAF history"]
  CAPTURE --> WARM{"Qwen loaded and RAM headroom?"}
  WARM -->|yes| LIVE["Live task: bounded chunks + speechWorkers decode"]
  WARM -->|no| DEFER["No live decode yet; defer model load"]
  LIVE --> PARTIAL["App Group partial + token/revision"]
  BUFFER --> STOP["Stop: endCapture + cancel live task"]
  LIVE --> STOP
  STOP --> WAIT{"Worker exits within 4 seconds?"}
  WAIT -->|no| PRESERVE["Save original CAF, processing failure"]
  WAIT -->|yes| SNAP["consumeAll FIFO -> savedSamples"]
  SNAP --> COLD{"Cold Qwen?"}
  COLD -->|yes| PARK["AudioSessionRecoveryGate.park / close without user Stop"]
  COLD -->|no| FINAL["Final native ASR and optional output"]
  PARK --> MODEL["Qwen native load with generation"]
  DEFER --> MODEL
  MODEL --> FINAL
  FINAL --> HIST["save History, original audio on ASR failure"]
  FINAL --> BRIDGE["Bridge output to original field (X4 review)"]
  FINAL --> RESTORE["Once: gate.take + session health restore"]
  RESTORE -->|allowed| ARM["AVAudioEngine restarted / sessionStarted"]
  RESTORE -->|denied F-0012| SILENT["Declined recovery incorrectly reported as nil"]
  CANCEL["Manual cancel/endSession/interruption"] --> INVALIDATE["Cancel parked gate; no rearm"]
  INVALIDATE --> RESTORE
  TIMER["Idle and 30min Timer F-0015"] -.->|stale MainActor callback?| CANCEL
  BUFFER -.->|F-0016 peak RAM unmeasured| MODEL
  CAPTURE -.->|F-0017 callback I/O jitter unmeasured| BUFFER
  USER -.->|F-0013 cancelled hold might start/stop| DARWIN
